This project adapts the shared UI layer of NSH (Native Shell):

  Source:   https://github.com/longbridge/nsh
  Path:     examples/nsh-gallery-ui/
  Baseline: 30f87b7c (the commit pinned in port-map.json)
  Copyright 2026 Longbridge <https://longbridge.com>
  License:  Apache License, Version 2.0
            https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

What was changed: the looks of the shared controls (their state design and
geometry) are re-expressed as copy-into-app components over `nsh/base`, with the
shadcn neutral palette in place of the original colours, the Terminal idiom,
sounds and the website playground adapters left out, and a Composition Facade
API. Each adapted file names its source file and the baseline commit in a header
comment, and keeps this notice's license: Apache-2.0 for the adapted parts.
